  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I bet these old bones have a fascinating story to tell. What do you say we go ahead and find out then? Oh wow. This is heavy stuff. It reads:",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_POL_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "At FirstWorld's Dawn did Light and Shadow play, across Land and Sky as One, bound by an unbreakable Seam of Borealis, never to be undone.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_POL_09.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But Titans in savage fury came, Raven and Spider's spawn. The unbreakable Seam was sundered; the FirstWorld was gone.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_POL_10.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Sorrow and Void remained, until pierced by Tree's humble song. Raven wove fragments together again... a Spiral of Worlds was formed.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_POL_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The largest Borealis Shard bound Land to Sky again; the Sky Anchor was then hidden away on the Horizon of Polarian.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_POL_12.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So the Sky Anchor's a real thing, eh? The largest of the Borealis Gemstones. I'm thinking you should probably go tell Baba Yaga.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_POL_13.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If I know Baba Yaga, and I actually do, she'll be wanting to hear about this Sky Anchor. I'd not keep her waiting, if I were you.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_POL_14.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
